{
  "rules": {
    "robin_bc_xmin": {
      "description": "Robin ghost-cell prescription at xmin for cell-centered uniform Cartesian grids (ESS §9.2 / §9.4). Robin BC: a·u + b·∂u/∂n = g, where ∂u/∂n is the outward normal derivative; at xmin the outward normal is -x so ∂u/∂n = (u_ghost - u[0]) / dx (centered diff across the boundary face, consistent with the Neumann convention). Solving for the ghost cell: u_ghost = (2·dx·g + (2·b - a·dx)·u[0]) / (a·dx + 2·b). Pattern matches the synthetic `bc` node (§9.2); `kind`, `side`, and `robin_alpha/beta/gamma` fields are spec-compliant annotations — ESS pattern matching on these fields is pending. `produces` declares the ghost variable per §9.4 (not yet processed by the current rule engine; documented for forward compatibility). Analytic check: a*(u_ghost+u[0])/2 + b*(u_ghost-u[0])/dx = g. Pure Dirichlet limit (b=0, a=1, g=u_bc): u_ghost = 2*u_bc - u[0]. Pure Neumann limit (a=0, b=1): u_ghost = u[0] + dx*g.",
      "pattern": {
        "op": "bc",
        "kind": "robin",
        "side": "xmin",
        "args": ["$u"],
        "robin_alpha": "$a",
        "robin_beta": "$b",
        "robin_gamma": "$g"
      },
      "replacement": {
        "op": "/",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  { "op": "*", "args": [2, "dx"] },
                  "$g"
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "-",
                    "args": [
                      { "op": "*", "args": [2, "$b"] },
                      { "op": "*", "args": ["$a", "dx"] }
                    ]
                  },
                  { "op": "index", "args": ["$u", 0] }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
              { "op": "*", "args": ["$a", "dx"] },
              { "op": "*", "args": [2, "$b"] }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "produces": [
        {
          "kind": "ghost_var",
          "name": "robin_bc__$u__xmin",
          "emit": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      { "op": "*", "args": [2, "dx"] },
                      "$g"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "-",
                        "args": [
                          { "op": "*", "args": [2, "$b"] },
                          { "op": "*", "args": ["$a", "dx"] }
                        ]
                      },
                      { "op": "index", "args": ["$u", 0] }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                  { "op": "*", "args": ["$a", "dx"] },
                  { "op": "*", "args": [2, "$b"] }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
